<%- include('partials/header.ejs') %>
<%- include('partials/main_nav.ejs') %>

<main id="wrapper" class="container">
  <h1 class="mb-4"><%= title %></h1>

  <!-- Bootstrap grid: 1 column on phones, 2 on tablets, 3 on laptops -->
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i> AI Cybersecurity Agents Project</h2>
        <p>
          I am working on an AI cybersecurity project where different agents are assigned their own
          security tasks. The agents are designed to scan networks, detect possible security problems,
          and send issues to the correct agent for further analysis and troubleshooting.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i> Cisco Packet Tracer Networking Project</h2>
        <p>
          I used Cisco Packet Tracer to build and configure different network topologies using routers,
          switches, and end devices. I practiced IP addressing, connectivity testing, and troubleshooting.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Tech Crew Event Setup</h2>
        <p>
          I worked with lighting, sound, and digital projection equipment for school events. I also
          helped organize technical setups and made sure the equipment was ready for each event.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-hammer"></i> Shed Construction Project</h2>
        <p>
          I worked on building a shed using different tools, materials, and measurements. This project
          helped me improve my teamwork, problem-solving, and construction skills while following safety rules.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i> Bench Construction Project</h2>
        <p>
          I helped build functional benches as part of a community project. I worked with others to
          measure materials, use tools, and complete the project safely and correctly.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer.ejs') %>